# EAS Build uploads from the git repo root (monorepo layout), which swept the
# entire 22 GB media-production tree into the archive (limit: 2 GB). Only
# mobile/ is the app — exclude everything else, plus mobile's own heavy/dev
# files. NOTE: when .easignore exists it REPLACES .gitignore for the upload, so
# secrets ignored by git must be re-listed here.
/*
!/mobile
/mobile/node_modules
/mobile/dist
/mobile/.expo
/mobile/credentials
/mobile/screenshots
/mobile/.env
/mobile/*.log
